WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.032
Roar!

2
00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:20.113
The lion pounced at Puss.

3
00:00:20.114 --> 00:00:23.408
Puss ran fast.

4
00:00:23.409 --> 00:00:27.754
"That lion is really the ogre!" he thought.

5
00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:34.254
Puss dashed down a hallway.

6
00:00:34.255 --> 00:00:36.582
He looked around.

7
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:42.463
"How do I get out of this castle?" he thought.

8
00:00:42.464 --> 00:00:47.433
Puss ran around a corner and saw stairs.

9
00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:50.796
The lion snapped his jaws.

10
00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:52.801
Chomp!

11
00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:59.637
"Yikes!" Puss ran up the stairs.

12
00:00:59.638 --> 00:01:04.209
Puss hurried into a small room.

13
00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:11.549
Quickly he slipped out a window and hid.

14
00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.482
Sniff, sniff.

15
00:01:14.483 --> 00:01:19.396
"I smell you, Cat!" the lion said.

16
00:01:19.397 --> 00:01:22.980
The lion's big head appeared in the window.

17
00:01:22.981 --> 00:01:27.578
"There you are!" the lion said.

18
00:01:27.579 --> 00:01:30.321
"Wow," Puss said.

19
00:01:30.322 --> 00:01:33.897
"You're good at changing shapes!"

20
00:01:33.898 --> 00:01:37.801
The lion nodded. "Yes, I am.

21
00:01:37.802 --> 00:01:41.191
I can change into anything."

22
00:01:41.192 --> 00:01:43.921
Puss rubbed his chin.

23
00:01:43.922 --> 00:01:48.627
"I'll bet you can't make yourself bigger."

24
00:01:48.628 --> 00:01:52.991
"Of course I can!" the lion yelled.

25
00:01:52.992 --> 00:01:57.412
"Watch!"

26
00:01:57.413 --> 00:02:00.093
The lion quickly grew bigger.

27
00:02:00.094 --> 00:02:04.003
Bam! His head hit the window.

28
00:02:04.004 --> 00:02:08.518
"Ouch!" The lion fell backward.

29
00:02:08.519 --> 00:02:11.128
Puss peeked into the room.

30
00:02:11.129 --> 00:02:13.869
The lion was an ogre again.

31
00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:18.032
He was moaning and rubbing his head.

32
00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:20.980
"This is my chance to escape!" Puss thought.

33
00:02:20.981 --> 00:02:24.785
He slipped back inside through the window.

34
00:02:24.786 --> 00:02:30.161
He tiptoed past the ogre.

35
00:02:30.162 --> 00:02:33.116
He was almost at the door . . .

36
00:02:33.117 --> 00:02:36.758
A big hand grabbed Puss.

37
00:02:36.759 --> 00:02:43.257
The ogre laughed. "Got you!"

